Grok Build (xAI) — design reference, no code copied
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
Source:    https://github.com/xai-org/grok-build (crates/codegen/xai-ratatui-inline,
           xai-grok-pager-render, xai-grok-pager-minimal, xai-grok-markdown)
License:   Apache-2.0
Copyright: Copyright 2023-2026 SpaceXAI

krowk's inline TUI (crates/krowk-tui) follows Grok Build's visual language and
two of its rendering ideas: finished output printed into the terminal's own
scrollback as text the terminal wraps (xai-ratatui-inline's
emit_to_scrollback), and the glyphs, commit rules and status wording of its
minimal inline mode — `❯` for the prompt, `◆` for a tool shown once with its
outcome, thinking collapsed to "Thought for 4.2s", "Worked for 12s", ` │ `
between status items, edits as removed and added lines on red and green
bands, fenced code without its fences on a background band. krowk's
implementation is its own: no Grok Build source file was copied or adapted,
so no Apache-2.0 obligations attach to krowk's code. The acknowledgement is
recorded here because the design is theirs.

